      "date": "1980-05-08",
      "kind": "planning decision",
      "description": "The City Planning Commission unanimously approved, with conditions, a planned unit development of about 141 dwellings, two shops and 141 parking spaces on the former Foremost-McKesson plant site (Resolution 8588).",
